# Output files
*.log
*.tmp

# Auto-generated fetch metadata (regenerated on each CI run) is written to the
# system temp dir: <temp>/filterfusion/*.json — it is NOT inside the repo, so there
# is nothing to ignore here. If metadata is ever moved into the repo, ignore that path.

# Auto-generated merge summaries (regenerated on each CI run)
/config/summary.json
/config/dns_summary.json

# Don't ignore dist/ directory - we want to track generated files
!dist/

# CDN 认证令牌：仅保留在本地，切勿提交（仓库历史中曾有记录，需用户自行轮换）
_cdnauth.txt

# 本地测试套件：仅本地维护，不随仓库分发（CI 不跑测试，Actions 全自动运行）
/tests/

# 类型检查 / 测试缓存
.mypy_cache/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/